# data/ holds both tracked, hand/agent-curated data (e.g. data/mnemonics/) and
# large corpora rebuilt from source (below) — only the latter is ignored.
#
# Tatoeba English corpus — large, rebuilt from source per data/tatoeba/README.md.
# README + tsv2vrt.py stay tracked. Applies to both copies (repo-root + skill dir).
**/tatoeba/*.tsv
**/tatoeba/*.bz2
**/tatoeba/*.vrt
**/tatoeba/cwb/
**/tatoeba/*.db
